# Software industry mapping for BPM
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/bpm/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:release_approval_case owl:equivalentClass sw:ReleaseApprovalCase .
legacy:release_approval_case_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:releaseApprovalCaseId .
legacy:architecture_decision_task owl:equivalentClass sw:ArchitectureDecisionTask .
legacy:architecture_decision_task_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:architectureDecisionTaskId .
legacy:decides_release_approval rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:decidesReleaseApproval .
